{"ticker":"RSL","symbol":"RSL","instrumentId":3201024,"name":"Rajputana Stainless Ltd","industry":"NSE-Steel-Producers","about":"Rajputana Stainless manufactures long and flat stainless-steel products. Its portfolio includes billets, forging ingots, rolled black and bright bars, hex and square bars, wire rods, flat bars and other ancillary products across more than 80 grades. The company operates an integrated manufacturing facility spread across 35,196.98 sq.m in Kalol, Gujarat. The plant includes induction furnaces, AOD refining, continuous casting machines, heat-treatment units, rolling mills and a bright bar shop to produce finished steel products. Its stainless-steel products are supplied as raw materials for industries such as seamless pipes, aerospace, forging, oil and gas, defense, automotive, aviation and precision engineering. Sales are mainly domestic, with exports to UAE, USA, Turkey, Kuwait and Poland.","website":"www.rajputanastainless.com","location":null,"exchange":"NSE","fetchedAt":"2026-11-20T13:52:07.446Z","basis":"standalone","price":{"value":170.2,"changePct":1.3517537069016743,"week52High":197.36,"week52Low":0},"stats":[{"label":"Market capitalization","value":"₹1,422 Cr"},{"label":"Sales","value":"₹1,172 Cr"},{"label":"Shares in float","value":"35,934,000"},{"label":"No. of funds","value":"12"},{"label":"Shares held by funds","value":"4,800,690"},{"label":"Dividend yield","value":"0.29%"},{"label":"Book value","value":"3.92"},{"label":"U/D vol ratio","value":"1"},{"label":"LTDebt / equity","value":"12.0%"},{"label":"Alpha","value":"1.66"},{"label":"Beta","value":"-0.05"},{"label":"EPS growth rate","value":"41%"},{"label":"P/E ratio","value":"19.06"},{"label":"5-year P/E range","value":"15–16"},{"label":"Return on equity","value":"13.7%"},{"label":"Cash flow (INR)","value":"3.84"},{"label":"Volume","value":"439,374"},{"label":"Avg volume (50d)","value":"380,842"},{"label":"Master score","value":"49"},{"label":"EPS rating","value":"87"},{"label"